ing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">도용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">누락한 경우 선정 취소될 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-left: 34pt; padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: -34pt;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;❍&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">선정된 팀은 동 공고문 및 안내 자료를 준수하여야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">이를 미숙지하여 발생하는&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-left: 34pt; padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: -34pt;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;불이익 및 그에 따른 책임은 동 사업을 신청한 팀에 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 돋움, dotum; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardCont